### 代码生成（已导入的代码生成业务表列表）
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/tool/gen/list?pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 代码生成表列表（按表名 / 表描述 / 时间范围过滤）
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/tool/gen/list?table_name=sys_&table_comment=表&begin_time=2024-01-01&end_time=2030-01-01
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 数据库表列表（未导入代码生成的表）
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/tool/gen/db-list?pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 数据库表列表（按表名过滤）
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/tool/gen/db-list?table_name=sys&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 导入表结构（tables 支持 JSON 数组，也支持 tables=a,b 逗号分隔）
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/tool/gen/import
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tables": ["sys_notice"]
}

### 导入表结构（逗号分隔写法）
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/tool/gen/import?tables=sys_notice,sys_post
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 代码生成表详情（含 columns / pk_column / tree_code 等树表参数）
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/tool/gen/detail?id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 代码生成表字段列表
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/tool/gen/column-list?table_id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 修改代码生成配置（表信息 + 字段配置，columns 可省略）
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8080/tool/gen/update
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "table_name": "sys_notice",
  "table_comment": "通知公告表",
  "class_name": "Notice",
  "tpl_category": "crud",
  "package_name": "github.com/bluefroog/admintpl",
  "module_name": "system",
  "business_name": "notice",
  "function_name": "通知公告",
  "function_author": "bluefrog",
  "gen_type": "0",
  "remark": "通知公告",
  "columns": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "column_comment": "公告标题",
      "go_type": "string",
      "go_field": "NoticeTitle",
      "html_field": "noticeTitle",
      "html_type": "input",
      "query_type": "LIKE",
      "is_required": "1",
      "is_insert": "1",
      "is_edit": "1",
      "is_list": "1",
      "is_query": "1",
      "sort": 2
    }
  ]
}

### 树表模板参数（tpl_category=tree 时使用，等价于 options 中的 treeCode/treeParentCode/treeName）
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8080/tool/gen/update
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "table_name": "sys_dept",
  "class_name": "Dept",
  "tpl_category": "tree",
  "tree_code": "dept_id",
  "tree_parent_code": "parent_id",
  "tree_name": "dept_name"
}

### 同步数据库表结构（表结构变更后重新读取列信息）
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/tool/gen/synch-db
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1
}

### 删除代码生成配置（同时清理字段配置）
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8080/tool/gen/delete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ids": [1]
}

### 期望响应结构
# /tool/gen/list
# { "code": 0, "msg": "success",
#   "data": { "list": [ { "id": 1, "table_name": "sys_notice", "table_comment": "通知公告表",
#                         "class_name": "Notice", "tpl_category": "crud",
#                         "package_name": "github.com/bluefroog/admintpl", "module_name": "system",
#                         "business_name": "notice", "function_name": "通知公告", "function_author": "bluefrog",
#                         "gen_type": "0", "create_by": "admin", "create_time": "2024-01-01 00:00:00" } ],
#             "total": 1, "page": 1, "pageSize": 10 } }
#
# /tool/gen/detail
# { "code": 0, "msg": "success",
#   "data": { "id": 1, "table_name": "sys_notice", "class_name": "Notice",
#             "columns": [ { "id": 1, "table_id": 1, "column_name": "notice_id", "column_type": "bigint(20)",
#                            "go_type": "int64", "go_field": "NoticeId", "html_field": "noticeId",
#                            "is_pk": "1", "is_increment": "1", "is_edit": "0", "is_list": "1",
#                            "is_query": "1", "query_type": "EQ", "html_type": "input", "sort": 1 } ],
#             "pk_column": { "column_name": "notice_id", "is_pk": "1" },
#             "tree_code": "", "tree_parent_code": "", "tree_name": "" } }
#
# /tool/gen/db-list
# { "code": 0, "msg": "success",
#   "data": { "list": [ { "table_name": "sys_notice", "table_comment": "通知公告表",
#                         "create_time": "2024-01-01T00:00:00+08:00" } ],
#             "total": 1, "page": 1, "pageSize": 10 } }
#
# 说明：
# - 「代码生成」只处理表结构导入与生成配置的维护；gen_table 仅能通过 /tool/gen/import 写入，
#   因此没有独立的 create 接口（避免出现与实际表结构不一致的脏配置）
# - 表前缀去除、包路径、模块名、作者等来自配置 system.gen.*（环境变量 GEN_PACKAGE_NAME /
#   GEN_MODULE_NAME / GEN_AUTHOR / GEN_AUTO_REMOVE_PRE / GEN_TABLE_PREFIX）
# - 列信息中的 is_pk / is_increment / is_required 与主键列由 information_schema.columns 推导：
#   字符串 -> string（text 或长度 >= 500 为 textarea）、时间 -> Time/datetime、数字 -> int/int64/float64
# - 列名包含 name/status 的列默认必填；status 列默认 radio，type/sex 结尾的列默认 select
# - 删除代码生成配置会一并删除 gen_table_column 中的字段配置（事务内完成）
